[chant:0154 invitation-to-the-devas-shorter-parittas]
[00:00.00]1 Pharitvāna mettaṁ samettā bhadantā
[00:13.00]2 Avikkhitta-cittā parittaṁ bhaṇantu

[chant:0155 invitation-to-the-devas-longer-parittas]
[00:20.45]1 Samantā cakka-vāḷesu
[00:25.76]2 Atr'āgacchantu devatā
[00:32.16]3 Saddhammaṁ muni-rājassa
[00:37.29]4 Suṇantu sagga-mokkha-daṁ

[chant:0050 invitation-to-the-devas]
[00:44.66]1 Sagge kāme ca rūpe
[00:49.63]2 Giri-sikhara-taṭe c'antalikkhe vimāne
[00:58.18]3 Dīpe raṭṭhe ca gāme
[01:04.09]4 Taru-vana-gahane geha-vatthumhi khette
[01:11.76]5 Bhummā c'āyantu devā
[01:18.50]6 Jala-thala-visame yakkha-gandhabba-nāgā
[01:27.15]7 Tiṭṭhantā santike yaṁ
[01:31.25]8 Muni-vara-vacanaṁ sādhavo me suṇantu

[chant:0157 invitation-to-the-devas-closing-at-the-monastery]
[01:40.00]1 Buddha-dassana-kālo ayam-bhadantā
[01:48.00]2 Dhammassavana-kālo ayam-bhadantā
[01:55.00]3 Saṅgha-payirūpāsana-kālo ayam-bhadantā
